&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:240,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;By submitting your application, you consent to Anduril Industries using a third-party service provider to conduct pre-employment risk, integrity, and due diligence screening and assessing potential risks as part of your application process. This third-party service provider provides risk-intelligence services that may include analysis of sanctions and watchlists, adverse media, public-record information, and other lawful open-source or commercial data sources. This third-party service provider does not act as a consumer reporting agency. Use of this provider helps to ensure compliance with applicable laws and protect technology, intellectual property, and organizational security.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Doctolib&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Doctolib Connect is a secure medical communication app designed for healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;More than 1M healthcare professionals use Doctolib Connect to discuss and coordinate patient care with colleagues both within and beyond their organizational walls. Today, Doctolib Connect is the largest medical network in Europe.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Since 2013, Doctolib has been striving for a healthier world by providing new-generation technology. With more than 2,800 employees across France, Italy, Germany and the Netherlands, Doctolib improves the daily lives of healthcare professionals and serves more than 80 million Europeans, offering a fast, frictionless, and secure journey for all their care needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you&#39;ll do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Fullstack Engineer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;to join the &lt;strong&gt;Doctolib Connect &lt;/strong&gt;team in &lt;strong&gt;Amsterdam, Netherlands&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Fullstack Engineer&lt;/strong&gt;, your mission will be to work on &lt;strong&gt;web features&lt;/strong&gt; for our secure medical communication solutions that enable healthcare professionals to discuss and coordinate patient care with colleagues both within and beyond their organizational walls. You will be working in a feature team developing a product that powers Europe&#39;s largest medical network with over 1M healthcare professionals.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in the tech team at Doctolib involves building innovative products and features to improve the daily lives of care teams and patients. We work in feature teams in an agile environment, while collaborating with product, design, and business teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities include but are not limited to:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frontend (React): building and owning web features, reviewing code and setting quality standards&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Backend and APIs (Java): API-focused work that supports the frontend and the features it owns&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technical leadership and delivery ownership: estimates, delivery plans, breaking down projects, giving the team context, accountability for results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaboration and team practices: working with the PM and Designer, supporting ways of working and processes, mentoring other engineers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Managing the full development lifecycle, including stakeholder communication and production issue debugging&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About our tech environment&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our solutions are built on a single fully cloud-native platform that supports web and mobile app interfaces, multiple languages, and is adapted to the country and healthcare specialty requirements. To address these challenges, we are modularizing our platform run in a distributed architecture through reusable components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Our stack is composed of React, TypeScript, Java, Rails, Python, Kotlin, Swift, and React Native.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We leverage AI ethically across our products to empower patients and health professionals. Discover our AI vision &lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.doctolib.com/ai-careers/&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt; and learn about our first AI hackathon &lt;a href=&quot;https://medium.com/doctolib/building-for-healthcare-our-first-ai-hackathon-aa9d10d1a250&quot;&gt;here!&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Before you read on: if you don&#39;t have the exact profile described below, but you feel this job description matches your skill set, we still encourage you to apply.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 5+ years experience working as fullstack software engineer on user facing applications&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience with React, Typescript and one or more of our backend technologies (Java, Rails...)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience running software on cloud infrastructure, ideally AWS&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience working with database technologies, preferably JPA, MySQL, MongoDB and Elasticsearch/Opensearch&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You enjoy figuring out why things work, not just that they work&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You&#39;re fluent in English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we offer&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension scheme through our partner Allianz&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;27 days of annual leave per year (and the ability to accrue more days on your work anniversary!)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from abroad for up to 10 days per year thanks to our flexibility days policy&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enrollment in Doctolib&#39;s long-term employee value sharing plan called DoctoGrowth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free mental health and coaching services through our partner Moka.care&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Free breakfast and lunch plan every day on-site&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bike lease scheme with our partner Lease a Bike, 35% price below the market&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Discounted membership with Urban Sports Club&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Continuous training programs on all key competencies (English, soft skills, expertise)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Reimbursement of public transportation if you live outside the Amsterdam highway ring&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Parent Care Program:&amp;nbsp; Various initiatives supporting parenthood, including 100% paid parental leave up to 16 weeks, including bonuses, for mothers and up to 5 weeks for the co-parent, flexible return and 3 days of leave per year for child sickness&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Relocation support for international mobilities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The interview process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recruiter Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coding Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;System Design Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Behavioral Interview&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offer!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;At Doctolib, we are committed to improving access to healthcare for everyone. This translates into our recruitment process. We evaluate candidates based solely on qualifications and motivation, without any form of discrimination.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;The more diverse ideas are heard, the more our product will truly improve healthcare for all. You are welcome to apply to Doctolib, regardless of your gender, religion, age, sexual orientation, ethnicity, disability.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;To ensure equal opportunities, we invite you to exclude personal information (e.g. pictures, age) from your applications. If you require any accommodation, please let us know for support during the hiring process. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Join us in building the healthcare we all dream of!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;All information provided is processed by Doctolib for application management. For data processing details, click&lt;/em&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://media.doctolib.com/image/upload/v1678356494/legal/Career-Privacy-Policy-Feb-23-EN.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;here&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;em&gt;. &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;Please contact hr.dataprivacy(at)doctolib.com for inquiries or to exercise your rights.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As our organization continues to grow, attracting the best talent remains one of our highest priorities. To achieve this, it&#39;s essential to adapt by refining our recruitment strategies, upholding exceptional quality in our efforts, and embracing innovative recruitment methodologies. This is where our Talent Acquisition (TA) team plays a vital role.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In the role of Talent Acquisition Specialist, you will play a pivotal part in achieving the team&#39;s primary goal: attracting and hiring the right talent for Vinted while ensuring an outstanding candidate experience. Leveraging your expertise in recruitment, you will implement best hiring practices and collaborate with other team members on various projects. You’ll support either our Group &amp;amp; Marketplace business units, covering Community Support, Marketing, Finance, Legal and People, or our Vinted Pay &amp;amp; VintedGo business units, covering AML/Compliance, Business &amp;amp; Commercial and Logistics, with your focus shifting based on business needs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you&#39;re excited to contribute to our team&#39;s efforts in supporting our organization&#39;s growth, we would love to meet you.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Note. This role is offered as a 12-months fixed-term contract initially. There may be an opportunity for the position to be made permanent in the future, depending on business needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with hiring managers to understand hiring needs and ensure a seamless interview process to attract the right talent&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end recruitment process, including job posting, proactive candidate sourcing, conducting interviews, and extending offers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build effective candidate talent pools through proactive sourcing, job boards, employee referrals, social media &amp;amp; employer branding campaigns etc&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Guide hiring managers and interviewers on effective interview techniques and candidate evaluation methods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track and report on key hiring metrics to ensure efficient recruitment processes, while providing a positive candidate and hiring manager experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gain exposure to talent acquisition initiatives by contributing to process improvement projects&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay informed about recruitment best practices and tools to continually improve the candidate experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous experience as a Sourcer, Recruiter or Talent Acquisition Specialist specifically&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency in sourcing candidates using LinkedIn and other recruitment tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in candidate engagement and relationship building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Good understanding of assessment tools and interview evaluation techniques&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English, with the ability to collaborate across teams and levels&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A proactive mindset and eagerness to learn and grow within the talent acquisition field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€47.300&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€63.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we grow the organisation, hiring the best people becomes one of our main priorities. To be able to successfully do that, we need to keep evolving: adjusting and improving our hiring processes, ensuring quality in everything that we do and creating new ways of working. This is why the successful performance of our Talent Acquisition (TA) team is highly important.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior TA Specialist, you will contribute to reaching the team’s main goal: attracting and employing the right talent for Vinted, while ensuring a great candidate experience. You will do this by applying your strong hiring competencies, effectively partnering with your Hiring Managers, leveraging innovative approaches, implementing best hiring practices, and collaborating with other teams on various projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll support either our Group &amp;amp; Marketplace business units, covering Community Support, Marketing, Finance, Legal and People, or our Vinted Pay &amp;amp; VintedGo business units, covering AML/Compliance, Business &amp;amp; Commercial and Logistics, with your focus shifting based on business needs.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you&#39;re excited to contribute to our team&#39;s efforts in supporting our organisation&#39;s growth, we would love to meet you.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Note. This role is offered as a 12-months fixed-term contract initially. There may be an opportunity for the position to be made permanent in the future, depending on business needs.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with hiring managers to define hiring strategies, prioritise critical hiring needs, and shape recruitment processes for best results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the end-to-end recruitment process, including job posting, proactive candidate sourcing, conducting interviews, and extending offers; including senior-level as well as highly specialised roles&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At times you may work in close partnership with the Talent Acquisition Support Specialists to maintain hiring alignment, ensure efficient assessment and selection processes, deliver hiring objectives, and provide ongoing mentoring support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as a strategic advisor to stakeholders, providing expertise on recruitment best practices, assessment methods, sharing market insights, and upskilling Hiring Manager competencies&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive initiatives to improve diversity and inclusion within the hiring process&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to drive innovation in talent acquisition, including new strategies, tools, and processes to enhance hiring and team performance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use data-driven insights to track, analyse, and report on hiring metrics, creating strategies to improve time-to-hire, quality of hire, candidate experience and wider TA goals&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct proactive market mapping to build talent pipelines, understand competitor landscape, and support future hiring delivery&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse inefficiencies in the hiring process, identify opportunities for enhancement, and lead process improvements in the recruitment workflow to align with and support the goals of a growing organisation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead talent acquisition-related projects, including process improvement, recruitment marketing campaigns, and technology implementation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stay updated on recruitment trends and innovative candidate evaluation tools to maintain a competitive edge in talent acquisition&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You will have proven experience as a Talent Acquisition Specialist or Recruiter&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You are proficient in proactive sourcing candidates and creating talent pipelines using LinkedIn and other recruitment tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have proven experience partnering with senior stakeholders and hiring Managers at all levels, with the ability to coach and influence toward better hiring outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong interviewing and candidate assessment skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to mentor and coach members of the team, supporting their professional development and growth&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have the ability to analyse and interpret data, identify trends and communicate hiring recommendations to Hiring Managers for data-driven hiring decisions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong skills in candidate engagement and relationship building&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication skills in English, with the ability to collaborate across teams and level&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€59.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€81.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

